<title>USA: Gibson Greetings Inc Q4 pro forma net rises.</title>
<headline>Gibson Greetings Inc Q4 pro forma net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pro Forma Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations (Amounts in thousands except per share amounts - Unaudited)</p>
<p>					   Three Months	Year</p>
<p>			     Ended December 31,  Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					  Pro Forma	   Pro Forma</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues		     $111,330 $119,151 $390,246 $388,884</p>
<p> Total operating expenses   98,556  107,827  351,719  350,448</p>
<p> Operating income	     12,774   11,324   38,527   38,436</p>
<p> Net Income			6,441    4,817   21,962   16,276</p>
<p> Net Income per share	   0.39     0.29     1.34     1.00</p>
<p>Average common shares and</p>
<p>   equivalents outstanding  16,633   16,306   16,448   16,243</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarterly and year-end pro forma results exclude results from Gibson's gift wrap subsidiary, Cleo Inc, which was sold in November, 1995. Including Cleo, fourth-quarter net income was $6.4 million, or $0.39 per share, compared to $7.8 million, or $0.49 per share, last year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
